ok 13 - a property node is exactly { kind, fieldId, propertyKey, fieldKind rich_text, value } with the stored rich_text.v1 of that property verbatim: its heading and its link reach the checker [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 14 - a whole rich_text value keeps its four-member node shape (no propertyKey) [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 15 - a scalar property and another locale's value are never nodes [P2-S11-AC-101]
