ok 18 - an unknown member (a token hash) is INVALID_REQUEST: the request is closed [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 19 - a malformed entry id is INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 20 - a non-object request is INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 21 - a null request is INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 22 - control: every refused request revoked nothing [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 23 - a takedown by entry answers { revokedTokens } counting the two unexpired active tokens of the entry (the expired and the already revoked are skipped) [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 24 - each revoked token is CAS-revoked: state revoked, revoked_at set, version + 1 [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 25 - an expired token and an already revoked token are not touched (no second version bump) [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 26 - the tokens of other entries are untouched by an entry takedown [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 27 - the takedown writes no audit record, event or idempotency reservation of its own: its caller owns the audit of the cause [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 28 - the CMS RPC flag is restored to its previous value when the takedown returns (SEC-2 D) [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 29 - a repeated takedown is idempotent: nothing left to revoke [P2-S11-AC-118]
