ok 34 - anon cannot execute the takedown [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 35 - authenticated cannot execute the takedown [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 36 - control: the refused anon and authenticated calls revoked nothing [P2-S11-AC-118]
