ok 38 - the minted token's capability_snapshot_hash is the BE04c actingContextVersion computed by cms_acting_context_version(person, acting party) [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 39 - composition: the verifier accepts the minted token when the caller presents the acting-context version [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 40 - composition: the service-role takedown of td-4 revokes the minted token [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 41 - composition: the minted token is CAS-revoked (state revoked, revoked_at set, version 2) [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 42 - composition: CMS-03B-19 answers valid false / revoked true for the bound owner of the taken-down token [P2-S11-AC-118]
ok 43 - composition: any other caller still gets the one byte-identical denial with revoked false: the takedown is no existence oracle [P2-S11-AC-118]
