ok 18 - a stale approved-review version is 409 VERSION_MISMATCH carrying only the expected and current versions [P2-S11-AC-020]
ok 19 - an invalidation advances the review version, so a command against an invalidated approval is VERSION_MISMATCH [P2-S11-AC-020]
ok 20 - a revision whose latest review is invalidated, rejected or open, or that was never reviewed, cannot be scheduled: CONFLICT [P2-S11-AC-038]
ok 21 - a tzdbVersion other than the pinned one is 422 tzdb_version_mismatch carrying the pinned value [P2-S11-AC-104]
ok 22 - a schedule under 60 s ahead, in the past or over 366 days ahead is 422 schedule_out_of_horizon with the minUtc and maxUtc window [P2-S11-AC-105]
ok 23 - a local time more than 14 h after or 12 h before the resolved UTC (no real zone offset) is 422 resolved_utc_mismatch [P2-S11-AC-105]
ok 24 - a cms.publisher grant that ends before the resolved UTC day is 422 authority_ends_before_schedule [P2-S11-AC-107]
