ok 22 - the document carries no author, owner, party or account identifier [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 23 - loading twice answers the identical document [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 24 - moving an instance changes the order and the render-plan hash [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 25 - with a template the instances follow its slot order (primary) and an instance in an unknown slot comes last [P2-S11-AC-101]
