ok 34 - an unknown phase, a missing phase or context, an unknown member and a malformed id are INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 35 - a document above 1 MiB is the uniform NOT_FOUND (the Worker then sends no evidence) [P2-S11-AC-101]
